aze  he's naruto's father and kind of made  the whole naruto as an underdog orphan  narrative change  into naruto is the chosen one with op  parents narrative minato took over for  sarutobi for  a while until he sacrificed his life to  save the village by sealing a part of  the nine-tailed fox into his son naruto  he was called konoha's yellow flash  because of his remarkable speed he was  actually part of jiraiya's team when he  was younger giving jiraiya a sort of  grandpa grandson relationship with  naruto jiraya said that minato was a  rare genius the kind of genius you don't  see often  the raikage admitted that minotau was  faster than him and that a finer shinobi  than minato never lived when the threat  of orochimaru loomed over konoha  it was suggested that minato could have  stopped him if he was only still alive  he really made use of the second  hokage's teleportation jutsu in fact the  second hokage mentioned that minato's  teleportation  is even better than his he used it on  himself and he even had enough chakra to  teleport a tail beast  he was also able to summon gamabunta  like naruto after him  also like naruto minato was known for  using the rasangan  he actually spent three years developing  it after he observed a tailed beast ball  unlike the previous three hokage  mentioned minato could not flex with all  five nature transformations but he could  use  fire wind and lightning along with yin  and yang release  before he died minato became the jin  turiki of the yin part of the  nine-tailed fox  after his reincarnation he actually uses  nine tails chakra mode which further  strengthens all of his attacks  lets him fire beedru balls aka tail  beast balls  and more although he could also use sage  mode he's admitted that it takes him too  long to build up chakra for it so it's  not super practical  and unlike naruto the dude was very very  intelligent and had the highest scores  in academy history all of this  definitely makes a solid contender for